OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sun 25 Oct to Tue 3 Nov
OL,6,FChangeable and at times unsettled,
OL,7,Fwith weather systems spreading in from
OL,8,Fthe Atlantic. These will bring spells
OL,9,Fof rain, heavy at times, together with
OL,10,Fa risk of strong winds or gales.
OL,11,FBetween systems it will be drier and
OL,12,Fbrighter with some sunshine, but also
OL,13,Fwith a few showers in places. Further
OL,14,Finto the period there is a chance that
OL,15,Fthe weather patterns could become more
OL,16,Fslowly evolving for a time. This may
OL,17,Flead to more in the way of settled
OL,18,Fweather, especially in the east, but
OL,19,Fthis is uncertain. Temperatures may be
OL,20,Fslightly below normal at first, but
OL,21,Fare likely to rise above average later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
