OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wed 4 Nov to Wed 18 Nov
OL,6,FThere may be a slowly evolving weather
OL,7,Fpattern at first, which could lead to
OL,8,Fmore in the way of drier and brighter
OL,9,Fconditions, especially in the east.
OL,10,FInto mid-November it is likely that
OL,11,Fchangeable and at times unsettled
OL,12,Fweather patterns will become
OL,13,Fincreasingly prevalent. These probably
OL,14,Ftake the form of weather systems
OL,15,Fspreading in from the Atlantic
OL,16,Fbringing spells of rain, heavy at
OL,17,Ftimes (especially in the west),
OL,18,Ftogether with a risk of strong winds
OL,19,For gales. Between systems it will be
OL,20,Fdrier and brighter with some sunshine,
OL,21,Fbut also with a few showers in places.
OL,22,FTemperatures are likely to be near to
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,23,For above average overall.
